## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to assemble a cohesive, beginner-friendly Azure stack with core services, PaaS patterns, security, monitoring, and basic DR.

## Key Concepts
- Static Web Apps, Functions (Consumption), Cosmos DB (SQL API)
- Front Door TLS endpoint, GitHub Actions CI/CD
- Application Insights, Azure Key Vault
- Tagging, budgets, basic cross-region DR

## Code Example
```javascript
// example: read a Key Vault secret with Azure SDK for JS
const { SecretClient } = require("@azure/keyvault-secrets");
const { DefaultAzureCredential } = require("@azure/identity");
const credential = new DefaultAzureCredential();
const client = new SecretClient("https://<vault-name>.vault.azure.net", credential);
const secret = await client.getSecret("DbPassword");
```

